[I] Small collection of solitaire/patience games to play in the terminal

[T] csol is a small collection of solitaire (patience) games implemented in
[T] C using ncurses. It includes Klondike, Yukon, Eight Off, FreeCell and
[T] others, configurable via theme and game definition files.

[U] https://nielssp.dk/csol/

